<h1>🌐 Internet Terms Guide</h1>

<dl>

<dt><strong>Website</strong></dt>
<dd>A collection of related web pages.</dd>

<dt><strong>Browser</strong></dt>
<dd>Software used to access websites.</dd>

<dt><strong>Server</strong></dt>
<dd>A computer that provides services or resources.</dd>

<dt><strong>Domain</strong></dt>
<dd>A human-readable website address.</dd>

<dt><strong>Internet</strong></dt>
<dd>A worldwide network of connected computers.</dd>

</dl>

